---
import StyleGuideLayout from "~/layouts/StyleGuideLayout.astro";
import HowItWorks from "~/components/sections/HowItWorks.astro";
import HowItWorks4Step from "~/components/sections/HowItWorks4Step.astro";
import Badge from "~/components/ui/Badge.astro";
---

<StyleGuideLayout
  slug="how-it-works"
  title="How It Works (Comet)"
  description="The default 'How it works' section. Dark theme, animated comet sweeping the progress track and lighting each step in sequence. Two variants live here: the 3-step canonical (in production sitewide) and a 4-step preview (NOT deployed — waiting on sign-off)."
>
  <section class="sg-section">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
      <h2 class="!mb-0">3-step (canonical)</h2>
      <Badge tone="success" variant="soft" size="sm" uppercase>In production</Badge>
    </div>
    <p class="sg-lede">Used on / (homepage), /how-it-works/, and every industry page. Three nodes, comet sweeps the track once every ~7.7s, lighting each in turn. Step 3 uses a homeowner photo that sharpens when lit; steps 1 &amp; 2 are icon nodes that fill with mint.</p>
    <div class="sg-preview" style="padding:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:1rem">
      <HowItWorks />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sg-section">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap">
      <h2 class="!mb-0">4-step (preview)</h2>
      <Badge tone="warning" variant="soft" size="sm" uppercase>Review only — not deployed</Badge>
    </div>
    <p class="sg-lede">Rework with four nodes and new copy. Step 1 anchors the anonymous moment (was "install"); step 3 keeps the dramatic reveal treatment; step 4 is new ("You Call &amp; Close"). Comet is retimed for four equally-spaced light windows over a 5s sweep, ~8.4s full cycle. <strong class="text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Sitewide swap is gated on review.</strong></p>
    <div class="sg-preview" style="padding:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:1rem">
      <HowItWorks4Step />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sg-section">
    <h2>4-step copy</h2>
    <p class="sg-lede">Source of truth for the preview variant. Final copy lives in <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">src/components/sections/HowItWorks4Step.astro</code>.</p>
    <div class="sg-preview">
      <ol class="list-none m-0 p-0 space-y-5">
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-brand-soft)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)] whitespace-nowrap">Step 01</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Anonymous Visits</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">A homeowner lands on your website looking for help, but you have no idea who they are yet.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-brand-soft)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)] whitespace-nowrap">Step 02</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">They Say Yes</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">The homeowner grants permission to be contacted and requests more information.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-brand-soft)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)] whitespace-nowrap">Step 03</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Warm Lead Revealed</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">Consent Resolve identifies and delivers the homeowner's contact information in real time.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-4 items-start">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-brand-soft)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)] whitespace-nowrap">Step 04</span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-display text-base font-bold tracking-tight text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">You Call &amp; Close</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">Reach out while they're actively shopping, build trust, and win the job before your competitors do.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sg-section">
    <h2>Mechanics</h2>
    <p class="sg-lede">Vanilla-JS timing logic; no React island.</p>
    <div class="sg-preview">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div>
          <p class="sg-label">3-step (canonical)</p>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-2 font-mono text-sm">
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Comet duration:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">4s linear</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Comet range:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">−120% → 360%</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 1 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">167ms → 1000ms</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 2 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">1417ms → 2250ms</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 3 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">2667ms (holds 4500ms)</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Cycle length:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">~7.7s</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="sg-label">4-step (preview)</p>
          <dl class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-2 font-mono text-sm">
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Comet duration:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">5s linear</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Comet range:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">−120% → 420%</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 1 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">250ms → 1050ms</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 2 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">1450ms → 2250ms</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 3 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">2650ms → 3450ms</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Step 4 lit:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">3850ms (holds 4500ms)</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="inline font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Cycle length:</dt> <dd class="inline text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">~8.4s</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="sg-label mt-6">Reduced-motion behavior (both)</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">Comet hidden, orbs frozen, steps fade in instantly.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sg-section">
    <h2>Illustrations (4-step preview)</h2>
    <p class="sg-lede">Brand-locked SVGs generated via Recraft (custom Brand Style <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">214dccd1-…</code>) and snapped to the 4-color palette via the HSL bucket pipeline. Source files: <code class="font-mono text-sm text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">public/illustrations/hiw/*.svg</code>.</p>
    <div class="sg-preview">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-navy-900)]">
            <img src="/illustrations/hiw/01-anonymous-visit.svg" alt="" width="80" height="80" class="size-20 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">Step 01</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Anonymous Visits</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">01-anonymous-visit.svg</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-navy-900)]">
            <img src="/illustrations/hiw/02-say-yes.svg" alt="" width="80" height="80" class="size-20 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">Step 02</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">They Say Yes</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">02-say-yes.svg</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-navy-900)]">
            <img src="/illustrations/hiw/03-lead-revealed.svg" alt="" width="80" height="80" class="size-20 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">Step 03</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Warm Lead Revealed</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">03-lead-revealed.svg</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="flex size-28 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[color:var(--color-navy-900)]">
            <img src="/illustrations/hiw/04-call-and-close.svg" alt="" width="80" height="80" class="size-20 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">Step 04</p>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">You Call & Close</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">04-call-and-close.svg</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="sg-label mt-6">Regenerate</p>
      <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-[color:var(--color-navy-900)] p-4 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-slate-200"><code>{`python3 scripts/generate-recraft.py --set=hiw \\
  --style-id=214dccd1-dca3-43e6-b005-c664e1b33338
python3 scripts/recolor-illustrations.py \\
  --in-dir=public/illustrations/hiw`}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sg-section">
    <h2>Tokens</h2>
    <div class="sg-preview">
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 font-mono text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">
        <li><span class="inline-block size-4 align-middle rounded mr-2" style="background:#0a1628"></span> Section bg · <code>#0a1628</code></li>
        <li><span class="inline-block size-4 align-middle rounded mr-2" style="background:#00E5A0"></span> Comet / lit · <code>#00E5A0</code></li>
        <li><span class="inline-block size-4 align-middle rounded mr-2" style="background:#062418"></span> Ink on lit · <code>#062418</code></li>
        <li><span class="inline-block size-4 align-middle rounded mr-2" style="background:#00A86E"></span> Icon at rest · <code>#00A86E</code></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sg-section">
    <h2>Promotion checklist</h2>
    <p class="sg-lede">When the 4-step variant is approved, swap is one rename + one import update.</p>
    <div class="sg-preview">
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">
        <li>Replace the contents of <code class="font-mono text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">src/components/sections/HowItWorks.astro</code> with the body of <code class="font-mono text-[color:var(--color-brand-pressed)]">HowItWorks4Step.astro</code> (or delete the old and rename the new — same component name expected by all callers).</li>
        <li>Search for class names: <code class="font-mono">.hiw4</code> → <code class="font-mono">.hiw</code>, <code class="font-mono">cr-hiw4-lit</code> → <code class="font-mono">cr-hiw-lit</code>, <code class="font-mono">cr-hiw4-comet-run</code> → <code class="font-mono">cr-hiw-comet-run</code>. (Or keep them — they don't collide with the canonical once it's gone.)</li>
        <li>Remove the "4-step preview" section from this style-guide page.</li>
        <li>Update the page-level heading copy on <code class="font-mono">src/pages/how-it-works.astro</code> ("in three steps" → "in four steps").</li>
        <li>Delete <code class="font-mono">HowItWorks4Step.astro</code>.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</StyleGuideLayout>
